  "description": "A bright and spacious second-floor one-bedroom apartment ideally located in the highly sought-after Forbes Quay development in the heart of Grand Canal Dock.\n\nThe property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with excellent storage, a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, and a separate fully fitted kitchen with all modern conveniences. The apartment features a generous double bedroom, a well-presented bathroom and a separate storage room. The property is further complemented by a beautiful private balcony, providing an excellent outdoor space.\n\nForbes Quay is a well-managed and highly regarded development, ideally positioned close to a fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, bars and local amenities. Dublin city centre is within easy walking distance, while some of Dublin's most popular destinations are nearby, including the Aviva Stadium, RDS Arena, Merrion Square, Trinity College, St Stephen's Green and the IFSC.\n\nThe area is extremely well serviced by public transport, with regular bus and DART services providing convenient access throughout the city. The Dublin Port Tunnel is also nearby, offering easy access to the M50 and Dublin Airport.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to rent a stylish and well-located apartment in one of Dublin's most popular areas.\n\nViewing highly recommended, please email only.",
